sonality: how a person acts or behaves.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The word <span class = \"strong\">very</span> shows how funny Peter is. Peter is very funny.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"7\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Adjective</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Description</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"brave\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person who isn't afraid of danger\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"generous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person who shares things with others\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rude\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person with bad manners\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"funny\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person who makes people laugh\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"quiet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person who doesn't talk very much\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person who is kind to others\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Peter is very nice.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Sally is not a quiet person.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Present tense of the verb <span class = \"strong\">to be</span> when you describe personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Form:      subject   +  to  be      + adjective <br /> Example: <span class=\"italic\">Peter is a nice person.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear in conversations about people.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "nice", "type": "name"}, {"content": "friendly, kind to others", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter is a nice person.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "smart", "type": "name"}, {"content": "clever; intelligent", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He is smart and very funny.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "boring", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not interesting", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter is in my boring business class.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "person", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an individual", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She is a nice person.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "people", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the plural form of person (more than one person)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Does he like people?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "business", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the study of money and trade", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter is in my business class.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "a little", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a 